{"additions":192,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Closes #212\n\n## Problem\n\nA PR row's `[draft]` and `✓` / `✗` badges trailed the title and the assignee / reviewer names, so in a narrow column they were the first thing cut off — a draft PR and a reviewed PR looked like any other open PR.\n\n## Changes\n\n- A draft PR's state icon is a dimmed `◌` instead of the green `●` (the same hollow treatment GitHub uses). The trailing `[draft]` badge is gone.\n- A fixed one-column review mark follows the state icon: `✓` approved (green), `✗` changes requested (red), `◯` review required (yellow), blank when there is no decision. The trailing badges are gone; merged / closed rows dim the mark with the rest of the row.\n- The PR detail header carries a `DRAFT` badge next to the state (`isDraft` joins `gh pr view --json`; older caches default to `false`).\n- The row is built by `row_spans`, so the layout is unit-tested (`draft_icon_and_review_mark_lead_the_row`, `pr_header_badges_a_draft`).\n- README en/ja, the guide's `views-github.md` en/ja and the PR tape are updated; fixtures and the GitHub GIFs are re-recorded (this draft PR is the `◌` example).\n\n## Screenshot\n\n![github pr demo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/td72/vig/feat/pr-state-icons/assets/demo-github-pr.gif)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01N7wFSHbpTzvkK6WS1CRS7b","changedFiles":8,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-11-05T07:45:35Z","deletions":74,"headRefName":"feat/pr-state-icons","isDraft":true,"labels":[],"number":213,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[],"state":"OPEN","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-05T07:48:56Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/41989491523/job/127118045982","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-11-05T07:45:43Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-05T07:46:17Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/41989491881/job/127118047700","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-11-05T07:45:43Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-05T07:48:42Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/41989491523/job/127118046007","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-11-05T07:45:45Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","conclusion":"","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/41989491523/job/127118045773","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-11-05T07:45:44Z","status":"IN_PROGRESS","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-05T07:47:11Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/41989491881/job/127118048164","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-11-05T07:45:44Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-05T07:47:53Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/41989491881/job/127118048003","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-11-05T07:45:45Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"}],"title":"GitHub view: lead PR rows with the draft icon and the review decision"}
